## 10. Risks and escalations

For material scope additions, record a bounded delta with design, timing, resource, validation and budget effects
and obtain the applicable approval before affected implementation. Defer unrelated additions. A failed early
proof or material estimate overrun triggers a compact checkpoint/correction, not an automatic Plan rewrite.

